					<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--color-muted);">
						Keep going: read <a href="/guides/how-to-pray/" style="color: var(--color-brand);" class="hover:underline">How to Pray</a>, <a href="/guides/how-to-read-the-bible/" style="color: var(--color-brand);" class="hover:underline">How to Read the Bible</a>, <a href="/guides/how-to-study-the-bible/" style="color: var(--color-brand);" class="hover:underline">How to Study the Bible</a>, or open the <a href="https://fathersheartbible.com/read/" style="color: var(--color-brand);" class="hover:underline">whole Bible free with audio</a>.</p>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="px-6 py-12 lg:px-8 lg:py-16" style="background-color: var(--color-surface-low);">
			<div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl text-center">
				<h2 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-light leading-tight" style="font-family: var(--font-serif); color: var(--color-ink);">Read Father&rsquo;s Heart Bible free</h2>
				<p class="mt-4 text-base lg:text-lg leading-relaxed" style="font-family: var(--font-sans); color: var(--color-muted);">Read Father&rsquo;s Heart Bible free online with audio &mdash; a translation that reveals God as a loving Father on every page.</p>
				<a href="https://fathersheartbible.com/read/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 mt-6 px-7 py-3 rounded-full text-sm font-semibold no-underline transition-colors" style="background-color: var(--color-brand); color: var(--color-on-primary); font-family: var(--font-sans);">Read FHB<span aria-hidden="true">&rarr;</span></a>
